# What a Docker build of this repository never sees (CS-119, deploy/docker/*.Dockerfile). The context is the whole
# repository, so this file is also what keeps secrets out of the images: settings files, version control, and anything
# that is rebuilt inside the build.

# Secrets and local settings: never in an image, a layer or a build log.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.claude/settings.local.json

# Version control, editors, agents' working folders
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
.claude
.playwright
.playwright-cli
.playwright-mcp
.captures

# Built or installed inside the build
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Not needed to build or run the app (the workspace's package.json files stay: the lockfile covers every project)
backlog
docs
.github
deploy
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
e2e/blob-report
e2e/tests
e2e/site
e2e/gorilla
e2e/fixtures
e2e/scripts
tools/site-capture/test
**/*.md

# The licensed typeface is NOT listed here on purpose: the web image's build needs it from this context (ADR-0015,
# docs/runbooks/licensed-font.md). It ends up in the web image, so that image is shipped to your own server over ssh
# and never pushed to a registry (docs/runbooks/deploy.md).
